PATENT COMMITMENT
-----------------
Implementing this specification requires no patent licence from the editor. The
royalty-free, irrevocable patent commitment in §12.2 of ASE-0.1.md applies to
every implementer without registration, fee, or contact, and is not conditioned
on any profile licence. Its only carve-out is defensive suspension against a
party that asserts a patent claim against an ASE implementation.

